==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Wicked Face]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
**10 [[Diabrollow]]s spawn after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Start off by building up cash, then hit the enemy base. With 30 Diabrollows in the boss fight, this stage is just a knockback Hellfest. Diabrollows hinder units like [[Dark Lazer]] from jumping Dark Dober, so your best bet is [[Pizza Cat]] with [[Octopus Cat]]. [[Esoteric Uril]], [[Ape Lord Luza]] and [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]] are also strong choices here.

[[Green Shell Cat]] is very useful due to the nature of this stage being relatively low-DPS based, with the threats coming from waves and Diabrollow's knockback, neither of which can affect Green Shell. As a result, it can hold the frontlines really well, and regular Octopus Cats behind Green Shell can protect your cat army.

